    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "What is the value of $\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac14\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)$?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac15$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac14\\right)\\times\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)&=\\frac12\\times\\frac23\\times\\frac34\\times\\frac45\\\\&=\\frac{1\\times2\\times3\\times4}{2\\times3\\times4\\times5}\\\\&=\\frac15\\end{align*}$$\nCancel the common factors before multiplying.",
